title: Southern Expedition
new-page: true
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/DengBenyin.jpg
tags: warlord_affairs
view-if: southexped_timer = 0 and southexped_active = 1
on-arrival: {!

Q.week_actions += 1;
Q.southexped_timer += 3;
Q.deng_casualties = 0;
Q.nra_casualties = 0;
Q.nra_winbeihai = 0;
Q.nra_losebeihai = 0;
Q.nra_winhainan = 0;
Q.nra_losehainan = 0;

!}

= The Southern Expedition

Deng Benyin's Bashu Alliance in Beihai and Hainan has been a pain in our backside in Guangdong ever since deng Jiongming broke with us. Now that deng Jiongming is gone, it's time to tie up loose ends and unify Guangdong.

- @thirdtrial: March through Beihai.
- @fourthtrial: March into Hainan.
- @root: We need more time to prepare!
- @easy_discard

@thirdtrial
choose-if: thirdtrialdone = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Beihai is already ours.
go-to: battlebeihai

@battlebeihai
on-arrival: {! Q.nra_power = Q.nra_strength * Q.nra_militancy * (1 + Q.nra_experience);
Q.deng_power = Q.deng_strength * Q.deng_militancy * (1 + Q.deng_experience);

Q.nra_casualties = (Q.nra_strength + Q.deng_strength)
    * (Q.deng_power / (Q.nra_power + Q.deng_power)) * 0.1;

Q.deng_casualties = (Q.nra_strength + Q.deng_strength)
    * (Q.nra_power / (Q.nra_power + Q.deng_power)) * 0.1;

Q.nra_vstrength = Math.round(Q.nra_strength*1000);
Q.deng_vstrength = Math.round(Q.deng_strength*1000);

Q.nra_strength -= Q.nra_casualties;
Q.deng_strength -= Q.deng_casualties;

Q.nra_vcasualties = Math.round(Q.nra_casualties*1000);
Q.deng_vcasualties = Math.round(Q.deng_casualties*1000);

if (Q.nra_power > Q.deng_power) {
    Q.nra_experience += 0.1;
    Q.nra_winbeihai = 1;
} else {
    Q.deng_experience += 0.1;
    Q.nra_losebeihai = 1;
}
!}
go-to: beihaibattlescreen

@beihaibattlescreen

<div>
  <div id="battle_screen">
    <div style="text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #999; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <span style="font-size: 24px;">Battle of Beihai</span>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; text-align: center; margin: 20px 30px;">
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <div style="color: #10186e;">National Revolutionary Army</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <strong>Troops</strong><br>
          [+ nra_vstrength +]
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
          <strong>Casualties</strong><br>
          [+ nra_vcasualties +]
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 20%; font-size: 20px;">VS</div>
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <div style="color: #d2cbd6;">Bashu Alliance</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <strong>Troops</strong><br>
          [+ deng_vstrength +]
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
          <strong>Casualties</strong><br>
          [+ deng_vcasualties +]
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #999; padding-top: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="font-size: 14px;">OUTCOME</div>
      [? if nra_winbeihai = 1 : <div style="font-size: 20px; color: #66BB6A; margin-top: 5px;">National Revolutionary Army Victory</div> ?]
      [? if nra_losebeihai = 1 : <div style="font-size: 20px; color: #d42f2f; margin-top: 5px;">Bashu Alliance Victory</div> ?]
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

- @winbeihai: Continue...
- @losebeihai: Continue...


@winbeihai
view-if: nra_winbeihai = 1
on-arrival: thirdtrialdone = 1;

We have defeated Deng Benyin in Beihai and have inflicted large casualties against his army! This is a cause to celebrate.

- @done: Hurrah!

@done
go-to: main

@donelose
go-to: main

@losebeihai
view-if: nra_losebeihai = 1

Deng Benyin's armies have defeated us! We have been repelled back to our starting position.

- @donelose: Unfortunate.

@fourthtrial
choose-if: thirdtrialdone = 1
unavailable-subtitle: We must march into Beihai before reaching Hainan.
go-to: battlehainan

@battlehainan
on-arrival: {! Q.nra_power = Q.nra_strength * Q.nra_militancy * (1 + Q.nra_experience);
Q.deng_power = Q.deng_strength * Q.deng_militancy * (1 + Q.deng_experience);

Q.nra_casualties = (Q.nra_strength + Q.deng_strength)
    * (Q.deng_power / (Q.nra_power + Q.deng_power)) * 0.1;

Q.deng_casualties = (Q.nra_strength + Q.deng_strength)
    * (Q.nra_power / (Q.nra_power + Q.deng_power)) * 0.1;

Q.nra_vstrength = Math.round(Q.nra_strength*1000);
Q.deng_vstrength = Math.round(Q.deng_strength*1000);

Q.nra_strength -= Q.nra_casualties;
Q.deng_strength -= Q.deng_casualties;

Q.nra_vcasualties = Math.round(Q.nra_casualties*1000);
Q.deng_vcasualties = Math.round(Q.deng_casualties*1000);

if (Q.nra_power > Q.deng_power) {
    Q.nra_experience += 0.1;
    Q.nra_winhainan = 1;
} else {
    Q.deng_experience += 0.1;
    Q.nra_losehainan = 1;
}
!}
go-to: hainanbattlescreen

@hainanbattlescreen

<div>
  <div id="battle_screen">
    <div style="text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #999; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <span style="font-size: 24px;">Battle of Hainan</span>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; text-align: center; margin: 20px 30px;">
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <div style="color: #10186e;">National Revolutionary Army</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <strong>Troops</strong><br>
          [+ nra_vstrength +]
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
          <strong>Casualties</strong><br>
          [+ nra_vcasualties +]
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 20%; font-size: 20px;">VS</div>
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <div style="color: #d2cbd6;">Bashu Alliance</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <strong>Troops</strong><br>
          [+ deng_vstrength +]
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
          <strong>Casualties</strong><br>
          [+ deng_vcasualties +]
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #999; padding-top: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="font-size: 14px;">OUTCOME</div>
      [? if nra_winhainan = 1 : <div style="font-size: 20px; color: #66BB6A; margin-top: 5px;">National Revolutionary Army Victory</div> ?]
      [? if nra_losehainan = 1 : <div style="font-size: 20px; color: #d42f2f; margin-top: 5px;">Bashu Alliance Victory</div> ?]
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


@winhainan
view-if: nra_winhainan = 1
on-arrival: fourthtrialdone = 1; southexped_active = 0; southexped_done = 1;

We have defeated Deng Benyin in Hainan and have finally crushed the last remaining resistance in Guangdong!

With Chen Jiongming in exile, Yang Ximin and Liu Zhenhuan's armies crushed, Shen Hongying defeated in Guangxi and now Deng Benyin's defeat, Canton is **fully** under Guomindang control. What a victory!

- @done: Hurrah!

@losehainan
view-if: nra_losehainan = 1
on-arrival: thirdtrialdone = 0;

Deng Benyin's armies have defeated us! We have been repelled back to our starting position.

- @donelose: Unfortunate.
